  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I hope the encryption of virtual avatars can be strengthened to curb the theft of private virtual avatars. The encryption of data transmitted between the server and the client should be enhanced to prevent it from being cracked and used to steal virtual avatars. Furthermore, the encryption of virtual avatars on both the client and server sides should be strengthened.",
